-- Smash history: the remaining old Brawl majors' sets, read by hand from Liquipedia's bracket pages (round 734's
-- way; Matthew, 2026-11-22: "Continue"): the Japanese KetubatoX, SumabatoX, Numabura and Umebura events and KTAR 6.
-- Several pages keep only a few sets. Scores as Liquipedia lists them; forfeits left out. Made with
-- tools/liquipedia/bracket-to-sql.mjs from tools/liquipedia/brackets/2008-2014-brawl-japan.txt. Safe to run twice.

-- manual/2014-sumabatox-final (brawl): 124 sets, from https://liquipedia.net/smash/SumabatoX/Final/Singles_Bracket
on conflict (set_id) do update set round = excluded.round, sort_order = excluded.sort_order, p1_name = excluded.p1_name,
  p1_score = excluded.p1_score, p2_name = excluded.p2_name, p2_score = excluded.p2_score, winner = excluded.winner;

